sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as User / Client
    participant UI as ConvoLab Studio
    participant API as Platform API Host
    participant Sim as ConversationSimulationService
    participant Settings as RuntimeConfigResolver
    participant Knowledge as KnowledgeEngine
    participant Prompt as PromptEngine
    participant Policy as PolicyDecisionService
    participant Intel as IntelligenceEngine
    participant Exec as IIntelligenceExecutor (Gemini/Determ)
    participant Eval as EvaluationEngine
    participant Trace as TraceEngine

    User->>UI: Sends Turn / Trigger Run
    UI->>API: POST /api/simulations/{id}/runs (X-Environment-Id, X-Correlation-ID)
    API->>Sim: ExecuteRunAsync(state, userMessage, config)

    activate Sim
    Sim->>Settings: Resolve effective configuration & secrets
    Settings-->>Sim: Governed runtime settings (pricing, limits)

    Sim->>Knowledge: BuildKnowledgePackageAsync(query)
    Knowledge-->>Sim: Sealed KnowledgePackage (ranked citations, tokens)

    Sim->>Prompt: RenderPromptAsync(template, knowledgePackage)
    Prompt-->>Sim: Rendered Prompt String

    Sim->>Policy: EvaluateExecutionAsync(PolicyExecutionRequest)
    Policy-->>Sim: Guardrails (Allowed, MaxTokens, MaxCostZar)

    alt Policy Denied
        Sim->>Trace: Record denied execution fact
        Sim-->>API: DomainRuleViolationException (policy.execution.denied)
        API-->>UI: 400 Bad Request / Problem Details
    else Policy Allowed
        Sim->>Intel: PlanExecutionAsync(context, requirement, policy)
        Intel-->>Sim: ExecutionPlan (Provider, Model, Fallbacks)

        Sim->>Intel: ExecuteAsync(context, plan, renderedPrompt)
        activate Intel
        Intel->>Exec: ExecuteAsync(request, prompt)
        Exec-->>Intel: Normalized ExecutionResult (Tokens, Latency, ZAR Cost)
        Intel-->>Sim: ExecutionResponse
        deactivate Intel

        Sim->>Eval: Evaluate(response, knowledgePackage)
        Eval-->>Sim: Scorecard (Groundedness, Relevance, Safety)

        Sim->>Eval: RecordSimulationRunAsync(runId, evaluation)
        Sim->>Trace: RecordSimulationRunAsync(traceSpans, telemetry)

        Sim-->>API: Completed SimulationRun
        API-->>UI: 200 OK (Run DTO, Timeline, Metrics)
        UI->>User: Displays Response & Run Inspector
    end
    deactivate Sim
